The Zorbon is a supposed entity that controls the minds of the unsuspecting. His machinations can be repelled by tinfoil, and so those that try to avoid his influence fashion clothing, like hats, out of foil. He's been described has having fungal qualities.

It's believed that the Zorbon is somehow related to [[Benjamin Grayson|Grayson]], the CEO of [[Org/Amber Call/index|Amber Call]]. Grayson's journal, taken from his private study, records experiments at replacing a person's motivations while leaving the personality intact, and the Party holds that [[Org/Amber Call/People/Mr. Whiskers|Whiskers]] was kidnapped because he stumbled onto that work.

Those who would know say the Zorbon can cause weather, such as a downpour that does not stop. A group called the [[Anti-Zorbon Taskforce]], of which [[Mr. Whiskers]] was a member, met in the sewers beneath [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Widdershins/index|Widdershins]] to work against him until its members were killed.
